Package: GradBoostR
Type: Package
Title: Fast Machine Learning with Gradient Boosting, Random Forests,
    and Neural Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Nic", "Coxen",
      email = "nicjcoxen@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
)
Description: Provides implementations of gradient boosting,
    random forest regression, neural network regression,
    decision stumps, and binary classification methods.
    The package includes a unified modeling interface,
    cross-validation utilities, prediction functions,
    and high-performance native implementations using
    'Rcpp' and 'RcppArmadillo'.
